{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-03-02 12:35:00', 'title': 'KROGER FULFILLMENT NETWORK EXPANDS WITH FACILITY IN CLEVELAND REGION', 'text': "CINCINNATI, MARCH 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA'S LARGEST GROCERY RETAILER, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL OFFER MORE AMERICANS DELIVERY THROUGH THE ADDITION OF A CUSTOMER FULFILLMENT CENTER (CFC) IN A NEW GEOGRAPHY – NORTHEAST OHIO. THE FACILITY WILL BE POWERED BY THE OCADO GROUP (LSE: OCDO) AND COMBINE VERTICAL INTEGRATION, MACHINE LEARNING, AND ROBOTICS TO PROVIDE AN AFFORDABLE, FRIENDLY, AND FAST FRESH FOOD DELIVERY SERVICE AS PART OF THE COMPANY'S SEAMLESS ECOSYSTEM."}